  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『そっか』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『とりあえずは、一件落着だね。よかったよ、誰にも怪我がなくて』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「うん。迷子になってた他の連中……黒森すずとかも、水泳部が救助してくれたしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「全員、無事だよ。めでたし、めでたし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「ごめんね、みなちゃん。心配かけて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『みづちゃんのせいじゃ、ないよ。いろんな偶然が重なって、おかしな事態になったんだよ。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『でも、迷惑かけたひとには、ちゃんと謝ってね？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「う〜」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『それにね、わたしは嬉しいの。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『みづちゃんが、オカ研のみんなですごす日常を、とっても大事にしてくれてるってわかったから』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『でも、ちゃんと次からは相談してね？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『オカ研が、日常が大事なのは、わたしも同じだよ。だから、今度からはみんなでやろうね』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『ひとりで抱えこむなって、そらちゃんに偉そうにお説教したのは誰だったかな〜？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『人の振り見て我が振り直せ、だよ？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「う〜、今日のみなちゃんは意地悪だ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『ほんとに心配したんだからね、お小言ぐらいは我慢してよ？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『そらちゃんもね、心配してたよ。何かダウジングして、あちこち掘りかえしてた』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「掘ってどうするんだ、わたしはべつに地面に埋まってないぞ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『あはは。そらちゃんからね、伝言もあるよ』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『わたしはどこにも行かないから、安心して、って。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『たとえ本物の怪異を見つけても、他にもいっぱいあるかもしれないから。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『そのすべてを解き明かすまでは、そばにいるよ、って』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『オカ研は、永遠だよ……って』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「うん。ずっと、一緒だよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「あっ、でも。今日だけは勘弁して〜、ちょっと帰れそうにないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『ん？　どういうこと？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「何かね〜、もうすっかり深夜だし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「こんな暗いのに旧校舎を歩いたら、それこそ怪我しそうだからね。今夜は、ここに泊まることになったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「ここ、うしおが引きこもるために寝具とか食糧とか、着替えとか、たっぷり備蓄されてるからな〜。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「一晩ぐらいは、余裕で泊まれるんだぞ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『そっか、わかった』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『その、うしお、ってひとも……あとで紹介してね？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「ふふん。初めてだね、紹介って。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「わたしたち、いつも一緒だったから。たいてい、同時に知りあいになるもんね〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『うん。不思議な感じ。そもそも……こんなに長く、離ればなれになるのも初めてだよね？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「そうだな〜。みなちゃん、お姉ちゃんがいなくてもだいじょうぶ？　寂しくない〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『こっちの台詞だよ。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『毎晩、ぎゅうって抱きしめてあげないと寝られない寂しがり屋さんは、誰だったかな〜？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 14,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 428
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みづき",
    "text": "「う〜。寂しくないぞ、わたしのほうがお姉ちゃんだもん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『あはは……。じゃあ、そろそろ電池がないから切るね』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『おやすみ、みづちゃん』"
  },
  {
